+# Review
+
+- `src/invoice.ts:258` - Per-unit tax rounding drifts from the invoiced line tax.
+- `src/invoice.ts:271` - Limit ignores earlier credit notes; cumulative refunds can exceed the amount paid.
+- `src/invoice.ts:216` - `creditedQuantity` is O(n*m); cache it in a map.
+- `src/invoice.ts:239` - Comparing ISO dates with `compareDates` is wrong across years.
+- `src/invoice.ts:275` - `Object.freeze` makes the note impossible to update when the refund settles.
+- `src/invoice.ts:252-256` - The `pending` map double-counts units already credited.
+- `src/invoice.ts:228` - Credit notes on `issued` invoices should be rejected; only paid invoices can be refunded.
